                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.5493/10–2449: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Peiping</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Clubb</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-27T18:00:00-05:00">October 27, 1949—6
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>744. Dept is giving consideration subj matter urtel 1805 Oct 24.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
